# The allowlist the quickstart arms the rehearsal's procedure with
# (HOOKPROBE_REMEDIATION_ALLOWLIST points here in docker-compose.quickstart.yml
# and docker-compose.yml). One regex per line, full-match, deny by default —
# the same file format an operator writes for a real node, and this one admits
# exactly the two observations the disk-fills script proposes. A real
# deployment writes its own file and never points at this one: a list that
# ships with the code is a list the operator did not decide.
^df -h /data$
^du -sh /data/results$
